<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces engaged militants in Kulgam, Jammu and Kashmir, killing Lashkar-e-Taiba commander Lateef Bhat during an encounter that followed a recent attack on a CRPF post. In Manipur, six Naga civilians were killed on the Imphal-Ukhrul highway after a 187‑day wait for burial, prompting heightened security operations and the redeployment of over 1,000 CRPF personnel from Chhattisgarh. The CRPF also withdrew its anti-Naxal battalion from Chhattisgarh to support Manipur duties. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to its report.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQYktYODJ2QmlFQVk5VWJGR3R5Y2g4WENRMHVzV3R5cUdLYWhqeHRsWG1IREVROUN3alFxc2FDOUJmallhb1lpVnRxX1V3bkF6Q2JfUjFhQzVxclJWVjhMMldvbGlibVFfNXJQdkwyaldzYlJmVVJoWnZ4Uml5S3A0VEV1ZFktbEpWSEw3c0RNb3NzYkNCRG45bmpKRFM5dndUTENtRmxqUld0WXBwRmdDMVlWUVhrbmJsQWZ2NQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;News On AIR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Firstpost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQV2MxRE52aFdIUEJQWjJfNDAtcnFxSWNYd3BKY3lNYndGUFlDWl9KNmtSUEIydm8tWlliSXhpand5R2xIV1VfUEQ3TEZlOUdFeDRMaldoREVlMVVvY3FaSDNweXFQbU91SkEzbzhXV2FsYjk4R1g0THEwWktGNjJ3dGVrT2FnN3RDZGwxZXVFSWlJYzdOaS1sYWsxUjE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPakhSYkdQZXlMcUI0T1dMRHM2RWt1eFZkdDZ1UHN5VmllQThPQVJPQjRvNm5rTy1uR0w3UU5ZakNPODJEa0pIR1RwQVZKT18zUTJ0alB5Y1Q4Umk2dmlxSnZxWDdrV3RaQ2xoQnRGNGttQ0U3V1B6WW1BZFZLZ3MyZHpwd1Q2THJ0WHRsOXF0TndtR0JLTUxJTGJpRENsSk1yU3RoTWE0TFpybk5EdkxoLW1Cc